A puzzle box stores uneven shelves with this fragment:
int[][] levels = {{3, 1}, {8}, {4, 6, 2}};
System.out.println(levels.length + "-" + levels[2].length);
What is printed?

A market totals uneven fruit baskets with this fragment:
int[][] baskets = {{5, 2}, {9}, {1, 1, 1}, {4, 0}};
int t = 0;
for (int r = 0; r < baskets.length; r++) { for (int c = 0; c < baskets[r].length; c++) { t += baskets[r][c]; } }
System.out.println(t);
