A lab flags warm chambers above 10 degrees in this grid:
int[][] d = {{12, 4, 19}, {7, 22, 3}, {15, 9, 11}};
int k = 0;
for (int r = 0; r < d.length; r++) { for (int c = 0; c < d[r].length; c++) { if (d[r][c] > 10) { k++; } } }
System.out.println(k);
What integer is printed?

